  posts:
  - title: New loading menu
    tag: 0
    date: 2026-10-17
    body: "Lethal Ape now opens on a new menu.\n\nHit <b>Play</b> to head into the lobby, catch up on dev posts here in <b>Updates</b>, or browse shots from around the game in the <b>Gallery</b> while you sign in.\n\nPoint with either controller and pull the trigger to select. Drag with the trigger held, or push the thumbstick, to scroll. <b>B</b> closes a post."
    image: {fileID: 0}
    pinned: 0
  - title: The Season Pass is live
    tag: 2
    date: 2026-10-10
    body: "The first Season Pass is here.\n\n<b>19 levels</b> of rewards, earned by playing and completing quests. The pass runs until <b>1 November</b>, so there's plenty of time to work through it.\n\nEvery level is unlocked by playing, and your progress is saved to your account."
    image: {fileID: 0}
    pinned: 0
  - title: Join the Discord
    tag: 4
    date: 2026-10-01
    body: "Bug reports, suggestions and the first look at new content all happen in our Discord.\n\n<b>discord.gg/lethalape</b>\n\nIf something breaks, a clip and the time it happened helps us fix it fast."
    image: {fileID: 0}
    pinned: 0
